                                    <h2>Arabic-first + halal + culturally-conservative requirements</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Arabic-first (not translated):</strong> Native-speaker Arabic writing + culturally-accurate messaging.</p><p><strong>Halal-compliant messaging:</strong> No alcohol + no pork + no non-Islamic imagery + symbols.</p><p><strong>Culturally-conservative model + imagery:</strong> Female models with head-covering + modest dress. Culturally-appropriate settings.</p><p><strong>Family + heritage + gifting narratives:</strong> Purchase framed around family + tradition + gifting + heritage rather than individual self-expression.</p><p><strong>Ramadan + Eid + Umrah + Hajj creative calendars:</strong> Culturally-specific creative for each peak.</p><p><strong>Modesty + luxury framing:</strong> Luxury + high-value framed with elegance + heritage rather than ostentatious display.</p>
